			<img src="/images/logo-64.png" alt="PluginDrop" width="28" height="28" style="border-radius:4px" />
			<span class="brand-name">PluginDrop</span>
			<p class="brand-desc">Curated plugin deals & free downloads for music producers.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="footer-social">
			<a href="https://bsky.app/profile/plugindrop.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Bluesky">
